  "oral_argument": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether there is overlap between the manufacturers of generic and brand\u2011name drugs."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor questioned whether the rule would have little practical effect because few lawsuits could be brought."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether causation required proof that the generic requested a label change and that the change would have been approved."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0011"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 29,
              "start": 29
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked the counsel to answer his earlier question (context not provided)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0014"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 32,
              "start": 32
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia inquired whether the three\u2011month turnaround mentioned by counsel applied only to requests from labeled manufacturers."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0015"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked about the source of adverse incident reports and the main obligation of the parties."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0018"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked whether a generic is required to file adverse incident reports."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0001-0020"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned whether a generic has a duty to lobby the FDA to change the rule that exempts it from a labeling\u2011change obligation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked why Buckman is not applicable here."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked whether state\u2011law claims should be allowed to proceed given the possibility of a generic requesting a label change."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0002-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 49,
              "start": 49
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked about the economic consequences of imposing a labeling\u2011change duty on generic manufacturers."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 50,
              "start": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether the statute imposes a legal obligation for all manufacturers to monitor drug safety."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked Mr. Lefkowitz whether he agrees with Justice Ginsburg\u2019s characterization of the government\u2019s position."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Lefkowitz",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0003-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Lefkowitz, Buckman makes clear that a state cannot regulate disclosure obligations that are federal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Lefkowitz",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3c4e4102dfa846f72807d51613cabfd0d0e09453270bd23a7dffe46717643f43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3c4e4102dfa8-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Lefkowitz, lobbying the FDA to change the rule is a fine distinction from the government\u2019s position."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Oral Argument \u2013 Justice Questions",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
